{"id":"sanctorale.11-03.german-speaking","source":"santos/santos_nov#1103Y","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["3. November"],["Hl. Pirmin, Abtbischof, Glaubensbote"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Vermutlich kam er aus dem keltisch-fränkischen Raum. Sein Mönchtum war von den Regeln Kolumbans und Benedikts bestimmt. 724 kam Pirmin auf die Insel Reichenau im Bodensee, später gründete er im Elsass das Kloster Murbach und war auch an der Gründung von Gengenbach beteiligt. Seine letzte Gründung war Hornbach in der Rheinpfalz, wo er auch starb, wahrscheinlich am 3. November 753."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für Bischöfe:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.pastors.3"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.pastors.4"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":", oder für Glaubensboten:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.pastors.10"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.pastors.11"},{"m":"link","t":"3","to":"common.pastors.12"}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Gott, unser Retter, du hast den heiligen Bischof Pirmin gesandt, damit er unsere Väter im Glauben unterweise und Klöster gründe als Stätten des Gebetes und der christlichen Bildung. Gib, dass das Wort der Frohen Botschaft nicht verstumme und dein Reich in uns wachse bis zum Tag der Vollendung. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"63","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"64","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis pastoribus "},{"m":"link","t":"... Quia sic tríbuis Ecclésiam tuam sancti...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos Pastores "},{"m":"link","t":"...Vós nos concedeis a alegria...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HOLY PASTORS "},{"m":"link","t":"... For, as on the festival of Saint...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos Pastores "},{"m":"link","t":"... Porque nos concedes la alegría...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI SANTI PASTORI "},{"m":"link","t":"... Tu doni alla tua Chiesa...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Pasteurs "},{"m":"link","t":"... Tu donnes à ton Église de se réjouir..","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HIRTEN DER KIRCHE "},{"m":"link","t":"... am Fest des heiligen N. deine Größe...","to":"preface.56"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.56"],"commons":["common.pastors.3","common.pastors.4","common.pastors.10","common.pastors.11","common.pastors.12"],"title":{"*":"Hl. Pirmin, Abtbischof, Glaubensbote"}}
